JavaFX Tip Calculator App
Aim: To build a Tip Calculator using JavaFX components and learn how to respond to user interactions through a graphical user interface.
Components used
- Label – Displays text such as Bill Amount, Tip Percentage, and Total.
- TextField – Accepts the bill amount.
- Slider – Selects the tip percentage.
- Button – Calculates the tip when clicked.
- RadioButton – Selects the number of people sharing the bill.
- Text – Displays the calculated result
